{"id": "DeHRyg8In01", "title": "Video by adilet.fndr", "description": "Solo founders don’t have a time problem, they have a headcount problem.\n\nYou can’t out-work being five people. But you can stop being all five.\n\nThis is the setup from the video: a CEO agent plans the week, and the rest just pick up their part. Graphics, scripts, SEO posts, an inbox report every few hours. You only get pulled in when there’s an actual decision to make.\n\nIt’s called Dock, and there’s a free plan if you want to try building your own team.\n\nComment DOCK and I’ll send you the link.\n\n#claude #aiagents #solofounder", "channel": "adilet.fndr", "uploader_id": "26455618998", "uploader": "Adilet", "timestamp": 1791205697, "like_count": 1694, "comment_count": 1398, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-29058282833858278a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.669, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fdac147-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNO_4a7oP9ZdC-mQbVBf70mDHxLFh12V0W8Gg8_RGevg4TRvw1emc1HFL4ZYetbBSIAQr5gbEag1ctTRVAc2jTQ-XMJpbccPDIY5ok.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=Adp_ypk-URzff2NrDZS0QMd3FsZTY2OAHJBhklX5dmR-VWh915y2EgB0UfKwUozNHIQ&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fdac147-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=5DtXd5sU7m0Q7kNvwGXZ4XK&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ob5rtKNG7dD-pdw5RaLZbw&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQO6eIwOnmaxAU_xmhkNrXfnGFXlaIfOsYJgkWIHRDC-GQ&oe=6ADFC343", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 64.669, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla